---
// Hero notice strip for keyboard shortcuts - shown on all pages
---

<div class="bg-emerald-50 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 px-4 text-[11px] text-gray-600 font-mono select-none">
  <div class="max-w-[1360px] mx-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
    <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0"><path d="M15 6v12a3 3 0 1 0 3-3H6a3 3 0 1 0 3 3V6a3 3 0 1 0-3 3h12a3 3 0 1 0-3-3"/></svg>
      Navegue rápido: Pressione consecutivamente <kbd class="font-bold text-gray-800 bg-gray-200 px-1 py-0.5 text-[9px]">G</kbd> depois <kbd class="font-bold text-gray-800 bg-gray-200 px-1 py-0.5 text-[9px]">D</kbd> para abrir especificações ou <kbd class="font-bold text-gray-800 bg-gray-200 px-1 py-0.5 text-[9px]">B</kbd> para o Blog dev.
    </span>
    <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-sans font-medium">
      Design Inspirado nos Manuais e Docs clássicos do Python, Rust e C++
    </span>
  </div>
</div>
